    "comment_data": [
        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Disabling in all modules is done by setting corresponding global or buffer-local boolean variable. For 'mini.trailspace' [it is `vim.b.minitrailspace_disable`](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/f3092db48dd2dfd3d32df5a5be4d56ed0c0b1ef9/doc/mini-trailspace.txt#L35-L43).\r\n\r\nSo to make it work, also add setting this variable inside autocommand callback:\r\n\r\n```lua\r\nvim.api.nvim_create_autocmd({ 'WinEnter', 'BufEnter', 'InsertLeave' }, {\r\n  desc = 'Stop highlighting trailing white space',\r\n  group = group,\r\n  callback = function(ev)\r\n    local should_disable = string.find(vim.bo[ev.buf].formatoptions, 'w') ~= nil\r\n    vim.b[ev.buf].minitrailspace_disable = should_disable\r\n    if should_disable then MiniTrailspace.unhighlight() end\r\n  end,\r\n})\r\n```",
